[0.375, "o", "\u001b[36m╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1mSamyama · Clinical Trials Knowledge Graph\u001b[0m                              \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \"What is being studied, with what, and by whom?\" — trials, conditions, \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m interventions, sponsors and the MeSH ontology in one graph             \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2mdata: AACT bulk download of ClinicalTrials.gov · real subset\u001b[0m           \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m\r\n"]
